ana with carquinyoli  in a white dish","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACrema_catalana_with_carquinyoli.jpg"}],"sounds":{"biscotti":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d8/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Flame%2C_not_lame-biscotti.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d8/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Flame%2C_not_lame-biscotti.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Flame%2C_not_lame-biscotti.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d8/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Flame%2C_not_lame-biscotti.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Flame%2C_not_lame-biscotti.wav.ogg"}]}}}